cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Q-Cog in research or teaching, please cite it as below."
title: "Q-Cog: a Qiskit-native quantum cognition simulation and visualization library"
abstract: >-
  Q-Cog is a reusable Python library and interactive platform for modelling,
  simulating, fitting and explaining quantum-probability models of human
  judgement, decision making and collective behaviour. Every model is executed
  with Qiskit, exposes a classical baseline for comparison, reports its own
  limitations, and ships with accessible visualizations.
authors:
  - name: "Q-Cog contributors"
license: MIT
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-10-11"
keywords:
  - quantum cognition
  - qiskit
  - quantum probability
  - decision making
  - simulation